{"sha": "f4a40b1418a84fbacb7484022147f62ddb21787c977f15b8a6761d469315c8fa", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b3:forms} 章 --- 微分形式与", "斯托克斯定理}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:forms:1}", "展开并消去重复的因子：", "\\[", "\\omega\\wedge\\eta = (x\\,\\dd y - z\\,\\dd x)\\wedge(\\dd x +", "y\\,\\dd z)", "= -x\\,\\dd x\\wedge\\dd y + xy\\,\\dd y\\wedge\\dd z +", "yz\\,\\dd z\\wedge\\dd x", "\\]", "（利用 $\\dd y\\wedge\\dd x = -\\dd x\\wedge\\dd y$ 与 $-zy\\,\\dd", "x\\wedge\\dd z = yz\\,\\dd z\\wedge\\dd x$）。接下来 $\\dd\\omega =", "\\dd x\\wedge\\dd y - \\dd z\\wedge\\dd x = \\dd x\\wedge\\dd y +", "\\dd x\\wedge\\dd z$ 与 $\\dd\\eta = \\dd y\\wedge\\dd z$。最后", "\\[", "\\dd(\\omega\\wedge\\eta) = y\\,\\dd x\\wedge\\dd y\\wedge\\dd z +", "z\\,\\dd y\\wedge\\dd z\\wedge\\dd x = (y + z)\\,\\dd x\\wedge\\dd", "y\\wedge\\dd z", "\\]", "（$\\omega\\wedge\\eta$ 的第一项贡献 $\\dd(-x)", "\\wedge\\dd x\\wedge\\dd y = 0$；三个因子的轮换", "都是偶置换）。莱布尼茨检验：$\\dd\\omega\\wedge\\eta =", "(\\dd x\\wedge\\dd y + \\dd x\\wedge\\dd z)\\wedge(\\dd x + y\\,\\dd", "z) = y\\,\\dd x\\wedge\\dd y\\wedge\\dd z$，而", "$(-1)^1\\omega\\wedge\\dd\\eta = -(x\\,\\dd y - z\\,\\dd", "x)\\wedge\\dd y\\wedge\\dd z = z\\,\\dd x\\wedge\\dd y\\wedge\\dd z$；", "两者之和相符。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:forms:2}", "$\\dd f = \\sum_i\\partial_if\\,\\dd x_i$ 的系数即", "$\\nabla f$ 的各分量。对于功形式，", "\\[", "\\dd\\omega_F = (\\partial_yF_3 - \\partial_zF_2)\\,\\dd y\\wedge\\dd", "z + (\\partial_zF_1 - \\partial_xF_3)\\,\\dd z\\wedge\\dd x +", "(\\partial_xF_2 - \\partial_yF_1)\\,\\dd x\\wedge\\dd y =", "\\sigma_{\\operatorname{curl}F},", "\\]", "即旋度的通量形式（合并", "$\\sum_i\\dd F_i\\wedge\\dd x_i$ 的六项）。对于通量形式，", "$\\dd\\sigma_F = (\\partial_xF_1 + \\partial_yF_2 +", "\\partial_zF_3)\\,\\dd x\\wedge\\dd y\\wedge\\dd z$，即", "散度。于是 $\\dd^2f = 0$ 化为", "$\\sigma_{\\operatorname{curl}\\nabla f} = 0$，亦即", "$\\operatorname{curl}\\nabla f = 0$，而 $\\dd^2\\omega_F = 0$", "化为 $(\\operatorname{div}\\operatorname{curl}F)\\,\\dd", "x\\wedge\\dd y\\wedge\\dd z = 0$：两个向量恒等式实为", "同一恒等式 $\\dd^2 = 0$，在两个次数上的体现。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:forms:3}", "(a) 闭性即混合偏导数的对称性：", "$\\partial_y(2xy + z^2) = 2x = \\partial_x(x^2)$,", "$\\partial_z(2xy + z^2) = 2z = \\partial_x(2xz)$,", "$\\partial_z(x^2) = 0 = \\partial_y(2xz)$。定义域 $\\R^3$", "是星形区域，故恰当（见\\cref{thm:b3:forms:poincare}），", "原函数为 $f = x^2y + xz^2$（验证 $\\dd f$）。", "(b) $\\dfrac{x\\,\\dd x + y\\,\\dd y}{x^2 + y^2} =", "\\tfrac12\\,\\dd\\log(x^2 + y^2)$：在整个", "$\\R^2\\setminus\\{0\\}$ 上恰当（从而闭） --- 与角形式相近的径向", "形式并无妨碍。", "(c) 在 $\\{x > 0\\}$ 上，该形式即 $\\omega_\\theta$，是闭的", "（见\\cref{exo:b3:forms:4}）；半平面是凸的，故", "在其上恰当，且确有 $f = \\arctan(y/x)$ 满足 $\\dd f", "= \\frac{-y\\,\\dd x + x\\,\\dd y}{x^2 + y^2}$。在", "半平面上恰当，在去心平面上不恰当：", "障碍在于洞，而不在公式本身。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:forms:4}", "闭性：记 $\\rho^2 = x^2 + y^2$，", "\\[", "\\partial_x\\Bigl(\\frac{x}{\\rho^2}\\Bigr) = \\frac{\\rho^2 -", "2x^2}{\\rho^4} = \\frac{y^2 - x^2}{\\rho^4} =", "\\partial_y\\Bigl(\\frac{-y}{\\rho^2}\\Bigr),", "\\]", "于是 $\\dd\\omega_\\theta = \\bigl(\\partial_x(x/\\rho^2) -", "\\partial_y(-y/\\rho^2)\\bigr)\\,\\dd x\\wedge\\dd y = 0$。取", "$\\gamma(t) = (r\\cos2\\pi t, r\\sin2\\pi t)$：", "\\[", "\\gamma^*\\omega_\\theta = \\frac{2\\pi r^2(\\cos^22\\pi t +", "\\sin^22\\pi t)}{r^2}\\,\\dd t = 2\\pi\\,\\dd t,", "\\qquad\\text{于是}\\qquad", "\\int_\\gamma\\omega_\\theta = 2\\pi .", "\\] 若 $\\omega_\\theta$", "恰当，则该积分应为零", "（见\\cref{prop:b3:forms:exactloop}）：它不是恰当的。若", "$\\R^2\\setminus\\{0\\}$ 关于某点 $p$ 是星形的，", "则由庞加莱引理（平移到 $p$ 处）可知每个", "闭形式都恰当 --- 矛盾。直接地，对任意 $p", "\\neq 0$，连接 $p$ 与区域中的点 $-p$ 的线段", "必经过 $0$：星形性在每一点都", "不成立。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:forms:5}", "对向量 $v_1, \\dots, v_{n-1}$，将行列式", "按其第一列展开，得", "\\[", "\\det(\\nu, v_1, \\dots, v_{n-1}) =", "\\sum_{i=1}^n(-1)^{i-1}\\nu_i\\,", "\\det\\bigl(\\text{行号} \\neq i \\text{ 的 } (v_1, \\dots,", "v_{n-1})\\bigr)", "= \\sigma_\\nu(v_1, \\dots, v_{n-1}),", "\\]", "由于 $(\\dd x_1\\wedge\\dots\\wedge\\widehat{\\dd", "x_i}\\wedge\\dots\\wedge\\dd x_n)(v_1, \\dots, v_{n-1})$ 恰为", "第 $i$ 个余子式", "（见\\cref{def:b3:forms:wedge}）。将此应用于 $v_j =", "\\partial_j\\gamma$：$(\\gamma^*\\sigma_\\nu)(e_1, \\dots,", "e_{n-1}) = \\det A$，其中 $A = (\\nu\\ \\partial_1\\gamma\\ \\cdots\\", "\\partial_{n-1}\\gamma)$。现 ${}^t\\!AA$ 为分块对角阵：", "$\\langle\\nu, \\nu\\rangle = 1$ 且 $\\langle\\nu,", "\\partial_j\\gamma\\rangle = 0$（$\\nu$ 为法向，", "$\\partial_j\\gamma$ 为切向），故 $(\\det A)^2 =", "\\det({}^t\\!AA) = \\det G$；且 $\\det A > 0$，对直接", "参数化（这正是 $\\nu$ 定向的含义）：", "$\\gamma^*\\sigma_\\nu = \\sqrt{\\det G}\\,\\dd", "u_1\\wedge\\dots\\wedge\\dd u_{n-1}$，即格拉姆面积元。", "对 $S^2$，$\\nu(x) = x$，球面参数化为", "$\\gamma(\\theta, \\varphi) = (\\sin\\varphi\\cos\\theta,", "\\sin\\varphi\\sin\\theta, \\cos\\varphi)$，定义在", "$(0,2\\pi)\\times(0,\\pi)$（直接的；它漏掉一条子午线，这是", "一个零面积集）：$\\det G = \\sin^2\\varphi$，于是", "$\\int_{S^2}\\sigma_\\nu =", "\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\!\\!\\int_0^\\pi\\sin\\varphi\\,\\dd\\varphi\\,", "\\dd\\theta = 4\\pi$。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}